# An allowlist: only what an image build copies. Every file left in the
# context feeds the hash of the images that install the project (the task
# images, the dashboard), so anything else here (docs, tests, git history, a
# pytest cache, the Flyte CLI cache, .env) would rebuild them on every change.
*
!src
!app
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
# The root Dockerfile's MCP config.
!.mcp.json
!.claude
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
**/__pycache__
**/__marimo__
**/*.egg-info
**/.DS_Store
